/* The documents, read with the `schema` rule: LANTERN_ABSENT and *out NULL for a
 * document of a newer schema, an error for one without `schema`; unknown members
 * are skipped. The text need not be NUL-terminated. Each document is freed with
 * its free function; what its accessors give lives as long as it does. */
/* handshake.json */
